\b\fs26 11. Rollback\b0\fs22\par
In GoDaddy DNS, \b delete\b0  (or disable) only the international CNAME.  \par
Remove any _vercel TXT that was added solely for this launch (if present).  \par
Leave all Finalsite / www / mail / nameserver settings untouched.  \par
Tell the ECI team so they can remove or pause the domain in Vercel \u8594? Domains.\par
No Finalsite \u8220?Domain is live\u8221? change is involved, because this hostname was never added to Composer.\par
